// MakinaTrumpetPoly.abcl — MAKINA-7 trumpet player as a SOLID, SHADED, polygon
// 3-D turntable (rendered, not wireframe).  18 frames of filled triangles with
// flat shading + back-face culling + painter's-algorithm depth sort, baked from
// the procedural character (character.js / standalone.html).  Each frame is one
